What is adapted from it here (issue #417, step 3), in Go, in
internal/node/device: how scrcpy-server is pushed, forwarded and started
(scrcpy-server-deploy.ts, scrcpy-stream-session.ts: the video socket tried
until the server's dummy byte, then the control socket), the control
messages' encoding (scrcpy-control-protocol.ts, scrcpy-control-input.ts,
android-input-mapping.ts: touch, key code, text split at 300 bytes, a point
from 0 to 1 in pixels), and the picture's size read from an SPS
(h264-sps-picture-size.ts, sps.go), with its test fixtures.
